			"notes": "## Changelog\n\n- Port to Ornithe 1.8.9\n- Properly spoof chat message widths\n\n*Small disclaimer:* This version of RankSpoof does not provide a config screen, so in order to toggle on/off the mod or change settings, you will have to use a mod like [OneConfig](https://modrinth.com/mod/oneconfig) or manually edit the config file.\n\n---\n\nThis is the legacy version (`v1`), made for 1.8.9. To see the modern version (`v2`), made for the latest versions of Minecraft, check out the [latest `v2` release](https://modrinth.com/mod/rankspoof/version/v2.4.0)."
		},
