			"notes": "## Changelog\n- Add RGB color codes.\n  - Using the format `&#RRGGBB`, RGB colors can now be used!\n  - Allows for [gradient colors](https://www.birdflop.com/resources/rgb) to be used in ranks.\n- Rewrite rank replacement logic.\n  - Fixes issues with modern style properties not working (e.g. RGB colors).\n  - Like always, there may be some bugs with the new implementation. If you encounter any, **especially instances where your rank does not get spoofed**, please create an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/cxntered/RankSpoof/issues) :3\n\n---\n\nThis is the modern version (`v2`), made for the latest versions of Minecraft. To see the legacy version (`v1`), made for 1.8.9, check out the [latest `v1` release](https://github.com/cxntered/RankSpoof/releases/tag/v1.1.2)."
		},
